'''Kart Driver''' is a driving [[Jobs|job]], specializing in racing. A sports class job, it has many combos and upgrades.

==Unlocking Kart Driver==
Kart Driver can be unlocked by speaking with any of the Kart Driver trainers at the various speedways.

==Trainers==
* [[Mustang Alli]] in the [[Frost Ridge Speedway]]
* [[Dane Blueshift]] in the [[Thunderfalls Speedway]]
* [[Johnny Thunder]] in the [[Wildwood Speedway]]
* [[Cale Yardbird]] in [[Briarwood]]

==Tracks==
* Frost Ridge Speedway in [[Snowhill]]
* Thunder Falls Speedway in [[Lakeshore]]
* [[Tangletrack Speedway]] in Briarwood
* Wildwood Speedway - near [[Sanctuary]]
* [[Sandstorm Speedway]] - in [[Seaside]]

